cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SELFSTATE, please cite the paper below."
title: "SELFSTATE: An OS-layer benchmark for self-state attacks on self-hosted AI agents"
abstract: >-
  Benchmark, corpus manifests and measurement pipeline for evaluating how far
  operating-system prevention, detection, provenance and recovery mechanisms can
  defend an agent's own persistent, behaviour-governing state.
type: dataset
